eta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"TechPickStream — Consumer Electronics Reviews, News &amp; Buying Guides\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TechPickStream — Consumer Electronics Reviews, News &amp; Buying Guides\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Expert reviews, in-depth comparisons, and buying guides for smartphones, audio gear, wearables, smart home devices, laptops, and gaming tech.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A761cc8cee43244d9973382fbb6c5bfea6.jpg\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"TechPickStream — Consumer Electronics Reviews, News & Buying Guides\",\"url\":\"https://techpickstream.com\",\"description\":\"Expert reviews, in-depth comparisons, and buying guides for smartphones, audio gear, wearables, smart home devices, laptops, and gaming tech.\"}</script><header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\">Tech<span style=\"color:#06b6d4;-webkit-text-fill-color:#06b6d4\">Pick</span>Stream</a><nav class=\"main-nav\"><a href=\"/smartphones\">Smartphones &amp; Mobile</a><a href=\"/audio-gear\">Audio &amp; Sound</a><a href=\"/wearables\">Wearables &amp; Smartwatches</a><a href=\"/smart-home\">Smart Home &amp; IoT</a><a href=\"/laptops-tablets\">Laptops &amp; Tablets</a><a href=\"/gaming\">Gaming &amp; Entertainment</a><a href=\"/general\">General Tech</a><a href=\"/author/team\">Authors</a></nav></header><main><div class=\"authors-page\"><section class=\"authors-banner\"><h1>Our Expert Authors</h1><p>Meet the professionals behind our content.</p></section><section class=\"authors-grid\"><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/alex-thompson\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>A</span></div><h3>Alex Thompson</h3><p>Consumer tech reviewer specializing in smartphones and mobile accessories. 10+ years covering flagship and budget devices.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/david-chen\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>D</span></div><h3>David Chen</h3><p>Audio equipment specialist and audiophile. Tests headphones, earbuds, and speakers with rigorous methodology.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/emma-rodriguez\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>E</span></div><h3>Emma Rodriguez</h3><p>Gaming hardware journalist covering consoles, GPUs, and peripherals. Competitive FPS player turned reviewer.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/sarah-mitchell\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>S</span></div><h3>Sarah Mitchell</h3><p>Wearable technology expert who has tested 150+ smartwatches and fitness trackers. Ultra-marathon runner.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/lisa-nakamura\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>L</span></div><h3>Lisa Nakamura</h3><p>Smart home consultant and IoT specialist. Helps readers build connected ecosystems that work seamlessly.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/nina-patel\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>N</span></div><h3>Nina Patel</h3><p>Laptop and tablet reviewer focused on productivity and creative workflows. Tests under real-world workloads.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/ryan-park\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>R</span></div><h3>Ryan Park</h3><p>General tech journalist covering emerging trends, product launches, and buying guides across all categories.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/james-walker\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>J</span></div><h3>James Walker</h3><p>Home entertainment and AV specialist. Reviews TVs, soundbars, projectors, and streaming setups.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/michael-brooks\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>M</span></div><h3>Michael Brooks</h3><p>Tech writer covering general technology news, product reviews, and practical buying advice.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/diana-kowalski\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>D</span></div><h3>Diana Kowalski</h3><p>Audio production and professional gear reviewer. Covers studio equipment and consumer audio products.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/sophia-lin\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>S</span></div><h3>Sophia Lin</h3><p>Mobile technology analyst covering smartphones, tablets, and mobile accessories across all price ranges.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/marcus-reid\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>M</span></div><h3>Marcus Reid</h3><p>Gaming peripherals expert covering keyboards, mice, monitors, and competitive gaming setups.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/hannah-cole\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>H</span></div><h3>Hannah Cole</h3><p>Smart home and IoT writer focused on practical automation and energy-efficient connected devices.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/ryan-tanaka\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>R</span></div><h3>Ryan Tanaka</h3><p>Laptop and tablet specialist covering ultrabooks, gaming laptops, and 2-in-1 devices for every budget.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/noah-carter\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>N</span></div><h3>Noah Carter</h3><p>Wearable tech and fitness device reviewer. Tests battery life, accuracy, and real-world usability.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/tom-hartley\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>T</span></div><h3>Tom Hartley</h3><p>Smartphone photography and mobile hardware expert. Reviews camera systems and processing performance.</p></a><a class=\"author-card\" href=\"/author/nina-walsh\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><span>N</span></div><h3>Nina Walsh</h3><p>Consumer electronics writer covering smart home devices, wearables, and connected lifestyle products.</p></a></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-content\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><span class=\"footer-logo\">TechPickStream</span><p>Expert reviews, in-depth comparisons, and buying guides for smartphones, audio gear, wearables, smart home devices, laptops, and gaming tech.</p></div><nav class=\"footer-nav\"><h4>Categories</h4><ul><li><a href=\"/smartphones\">Smartphones &amp; Mobile</a></li><li><a href=\"/audio-gear\">Audio &amp; Sound</a></li><li><a href=\"/wearables\">Wearables &amp; Smartwatches</a></li><li><a href=\"/smart-home\">Smart Home &amp; IoT</a></li><li><a href=\"/laptops-tablets\">Laptops &amp; Tablets</a></li><li><a href=\"/gaming\">Gaming &amp; Entertainment</a></li><li><a href=\"/general\">General Tech</a></li></ul></nav><nav class=\"footer-nav\"><h4>Site</h4><ul><li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"/author/team\">Authors</a></li></ul></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->TechPickStream — Consumer Electronics Reviews, News &amp; Buying Guides<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/09_s5dke11abe.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[79520,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0t0~vf8vpn6e-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0t0~vf8vpn6e-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0t0~vf8vpn6e-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0t0~vf8vpn6e-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0t0~vf8vpn6e-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/